{#- The day's tasks input (subconscious/day_tasks.py). Expects agent_input: day, items [{label, time, statement,
    related: [statement], current: the item's entry on the brain's list {decision, assistant_part, when, why,
    decided_at (UTC ISO)}, or None}], situation (subconscious/situation.py, rendered by shared/brain/situation.j2;
    its concerns carry their whole record and their entries; its citable facts carry `ref` labels), matters (what
    the brain decided today, day_tasks.matters_today, each with `ref`), correction. Times are shown local. -#}
{%- set A = agent_input -%}
{%- macro item(it) %}
[{{ it.label }}] {{ "All day" if it.time == "all day" else "At " ~ it.time }}: {{ it.statement }}
{%- for r in it.related %}
    read with: {{ r }}
{%- endfor %}
{%- endmacro -%}
## Today's calendar ({{ A.day }})

### Not yet on the list (decide each)
{% for it in A["items"] if not it.current %}{{ item(it) }}
{% else %}
(none)
{% endfor %}
### Already on the list (each stays as it is unless something new since it was decided changes it)
{% for it in A["items"] if it.current %}{{ item(it) }}
    on the list since {{ it.current.decided_at | local_time }}: {% if it.current.decision == "needed" %}needed: {{ it.current.assistant_part }}, {{ it.current.when }}{% else %}{{ it.current.decision | replace("_", " ") }}: {{ it.current.why }}{% endif %}
{% else %}
(none)
{% endfor %}
{% with s = A.situation %}{% include 'shared/brain/situation.j2' %}{% endwith %}

## What the brain read and decided today
{% for m in A.matters -%}
### [{{ m.ref }}] {{ m.at | local_time }}
{% for e in m.events -%}
- {{ e.source }} at {{ e.at | local_time }}: {{ e.text }}
  the brain: {{ e.decision | replace("_", " ") }}: {{ e.reason }}
{% endfor -%}
{% for n in m.notes -%}
- note on a concern: {{ n.note }}
{% endfor -%}
{% for n in m.new_concerns -%}
- raised a concern: {{ n.title }}
{% endfor %}
{% else -%}
(nothing yet today)
{% endfor %}
{% if A.correction %}
## Your previous answer was refused
{{ A.correction }}
{% endif %}
Decide every item not yet on the list, and an item on the list only when something new changes it.
